  {
   "title": "Recommended to clone (20)",
   "blocks": [
    {
     "type": "paragraph",
     "text": "The picks favour reusable Verilog blocks and board example sets on the open flow."
    },
    {
     "type": "list",
     "ordered": true,
     "items": [
      "**ulixxe/usb_cdc**: pure-Verilog FS USB CDC-ACM core with 21 board pcfs. The most reusable block found, and it ports to ULX3S US2.",
      "**daveshah1/up5k-demos**: UP5K demos from the nextpnr author, covering hard IP (SPRAM, DSP).",
      "**Wren6991/SmolDVI**: tiny TMDS/DVI encoder (CC0) for small iCE40 parts.",
      "**gtjennings1/HyperBUS**: standalone HyperRAM controller.",
      "**im-tomu/fomu-workshop**: official Fomu examples (Verilog + VHDL + LiteX).",
      "**daglem/reDIP-SID**: high-quality SystemVerilog SID emulation, and the audio blocks can be reused.",
      "**badgeteam/mch2022-firmware-ice40**: badge examples (LCD, PSRAM, SPI slave).",
      "**smunaut/mch2022-ice40**: tnt's reusable no2 cores on UP5K.",
      "**osmocom/osmo-e1-hardware**: icE1usb gateware (E1 framer + USB), production code.",
      "**alangarf/apple-one**: Apple-1 system with many board ports, including an ECP5 lpf.",
      "**emeb/up5k_osc**: ADC/DSP oscilloscope gateware (active 2024).",
      "**emeb/up5k_vga**: 65C02 + VGA computer (the emeb up5k_* family; `up5k_basic` is the smaller sibling).",
      "**ToNi3141/RasteriCEr**: OpenGL-style rasteriser, a rare 3D graphics pipeline in Verilog.",
      "**nickmqb/fpga_craft**: 3D voxel renderer on UP5K (generated Verilog, 214 stars).",
      "**WiFiBoy/OK-iCE40Pro**: 13 example designs for a game-board (LCD, audio).",
      "**pablogs9/RocketFPGA**: audio codec + DSP gateware.",
      "**tinyvision-ai-inc/pico-ice-sdk**: vendor examples for pico-ice/pico2-ice (MCU+FPGA co-design).",
      "**ranzbak/fpga-workshop**: 15-step UPduino tutorial on the open flow.",
      "**NUSGreyhats/greybadge25**: new ECP5 LFE5U-25F badge with open-flow gateware (2026).",
      "**machdyne/fpga-dac**: sigma-delta DAC/PCM player with ECP5 lpfs (12k/45k), a small reusable block."
     ]
    },
    {
     "type": "paragraph",
     "text": "Runners-up: osresearch/risc8 (AVR-compatible core), nkrackow/SingularitySurfer lock-in amplifier (DSP), mmicko/fpga101-workshop,\nICE-V-Wireless/ICE-V-Wireless, emeb/ice-dongle, tinyvision-ai-inc/Vision-FPGA-SoM, igor-m/UPduino-Mecrisp-Ice."
    }
   ]
